# Moonlight Syndrome (SLPS-01001), the chapter in DENPOW.DAT on disc 2 (SLPS-01002). This chapter's kanji and
# marks, 0x0100-0x026E, in the order of the chapter's font on the disc (the archive's entry 3); 16-bit codes, high
# byte first. Goes after tables/human-kana.tbl (the codes every chapter shares).
# Read by eye from the font, then checked in this and the other chapters' script words. 337 of the 367 are used by
# this chapter's script.
# Not checked in a scene, since no chapter's script uses the glyph: 0x0193, 0x0196, 0x019A, 0x01AB, 0x01D3, 0x01D5,
# 0x0207, 0x0208, 0x0209.
